            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um método <code>move()</code> e chame-o através da instância <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"190\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"194\" endIndex=\"202\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(speed) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".speed = speed;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" move() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;moving at speed &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".speed);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hero = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hero.move();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>move() {</code> seguido de <code>}</code> e depois <code>hero</code>, <code>.move();</code>.</p></body></html>"
