          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150071,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escolha o trecho de código que chama o método <code>attack()</code> da classe <code>Weapon</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"attack(damage);\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"172\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage dealt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (damage === \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack(damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>super.attack(damage);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150072,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage dealt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Super.attack(damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code> está em maiúsculas; deveria ser <code>super.attack(damage);</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Subclasses não devem chamar <code>super()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>super</code> está em maiúsculas; deveria ser <code>super.attack(damage);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao chamar o método <code>super()</code>, quantos parâmetros ele deve ter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O mesmo número de parâmetros que o construtor da superclasse</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nenhum</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quantos a subclasse precisar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O mesmo número de parâmetros que o construtor da superclasse.</p></body></html>"
